Freedom Supplier
- Shop
	- Bulletproof Vest - $670
		if {Global.player_money} >= 670:
			do Inventory.add_item("Vest")
		else:
			Not enough money
	- 9mm Handgun - $420
		if {Global.player_money} >= 420:
			do Inventory.add_item("Gun")
		else:
			Not enough money
	- Ammo - $10
		if {Inventory.has_item("Gun")} and {Global.player_money} >= 10:
			do Inventory.add_item("Bullet")
		elif {!Inventory.has_item("Gun")}:
			What are you gonna do with just a bullet?? Buy a gun first!
		elif {Inventory.has_item("Gun")} and {Global.player_money} < 10:
			Not enough money
- Ask for catalytic converter | [if {catalytic_sold_gun} == false] [else="hide"]
	Vincenzo, the gun store owner, says he's winning to part with his own if you can find him a vintage gun
	- Commence the trade
		if {Inventory.has_item("Vintage_Gun")}:
			Vincenzo is real happy. He gleefully hands you his converter.
			do Inventory.remove_item("Vintage_Gun")
			do Inventory.add_item("Catalytic_Converter")
			set {catalytic_sold_gun} = true
		else:
			You don't have a vintage gun...
- Ask for Shelter
	Vincenzo, the gun store owner, eyes your pockets and hands before accepting. Are you sure you want to continue?
	- Yes
		The day passes... you swear your belongings are a little lighter now
		You lose 15 money
		set {Global.player_money} -= 15
		do Global.sleep()
	- No
		Too bad, you get knocked out and lose some cash
		You lose 20 money
		set {Global.player_money} -= 20
		do Global.sleep()